Resolving a name

The `Laptop` asks the `Resolver`, with the label `ask`. The `Resolver` asks the
`Root server`, then the `TLD server`, then the `Authoritative server`, each
with the label `ask`. Each of the three answers the `Resolver` with the label
`referral`.
---
Laptop -> Resolver: ask
Resolver -> Root server, TLD server, Authoritative server: ask
Root server, TLD server, Authoritative server -> Resolver: referral
